<title>PHILIPPINES: TABLE - METROPAC 6-MTH NET 420.4 MLN PESOS.</title>
<headline>TABLE - METROPAC 6-MTH NET 420.4 MLN PESOS.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>	    (in million pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (centavos)   15.17 vs n/a</p>
<p>    Net income			    420.4 vs 164</p>
<p>Note: Full name Metro Pacific Corp. The company said the net income excludes other income. It said its unaudited consolidated net income was 574 million pesos from 393 million in the year-ago period. Metro Pacific is the flagship company of First Pacific Co Ltd in the Philippines.</p>
